Package: lab4ridge
Title: Linear Regression and Ridge Regression Using Using QR Decomposition 
    and Reference Classes
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Jonas", "Hautamäki Bengtsson", , "jonha849@student.liu.se", 
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Implements multiple linear regression and ridge regression with 
    the coefficients and their variances computed using the QR decomposition. 
    The results are stored in reference class objects with methods for 
    printing, plotting, residuals, predictions, coefficients and a summary of 
    the fitted model.
